This C# Assert statement refers to the "Contains" function which checks if an element is present or not using "Array.IndexOf" method. The "Array.IndexOf" returns a non-negative number if the element is present in the list, otherwise -1 if the item is not present in the list. Thus, the Assert statement checks whether the item to be added to the list is present at the index location or not.--------------------
